WEBVTT

00:15:29.371 --> 00:15:34.912
And as I said, we were always flat broke
and he was injured and out of work

00:15:34.912 --> 00:15:37.871
for more than a year. And my mom
at the time was working as

00:15:38.162 --> 00:15:41.912
an administrative assistant for the like
the small town attorney in Chaska,

00:15:41.912 --> 00:15:45.787
Minnesota. And he said, you know,
I'll represent you pro bono.

00:15:45.787 --> 00:15:49.412
It's not fair because my stepfather
was working under the table.

00:15:49.412 --> 00:15:51.662
His boss said, oh, no, I don't
need to pay you anything.

00:15:52.079 --> 00:15:55.079
So by the end of the year, they got
a twelve thousand dollar check.

00:15:55.079 --> 00:16:00.162
That was the payment for a broken
back back in 1980 or so.